<title>USA: GOLF-FINAL SCORES FROM THE DORAL-RYDER OPEN.</title>
<headline>GOLF-FINAL SCORES FROM THE DORAL-RYDER OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final round scores from the</p>
<p>$1.8 million Doral-Ryder Open golf tournament, won by Steve</p>
<p>Elkington on Sunday (U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>275  Steve Elkington (Australia) 70 66 70 69</p>
<p>277  Larry Nelson 72 66 69 70, Nick Price (Zimababwe) 68 67 70</p>
<p>     72</p>
<p>278  David Duval 68 66 70 74</p>
<p>280  Fulton Allem (South Africa) 70 70 70 70, Robert Damron 72</p>
<p>     66 71 71, Ronnie Black 67 71 70 72</p>
<p>281  Brad Bryant 69 70 74 68</p>
<p>282  Wayne Levi 70 72 68 72, Craig Stadler 71 72 67 72, Greg</p>
<p>     Norman (Australia) 66 68 74 74, Bob Tway 66 70 71 75</p>
<p>283  Billy Mayfair 70 67 77 69, Jay Haas 67 72 74 70, Vijay</p>
<p>     Singh (Fiji) 72 72 69 70, Chris Perry 71 67 72 73</p>
<p>284  Mike Brisky 70 71 72 71</p>
<p>285  Michael Bradley 70 71 76 68, Doug Martin 67 71 74 73</p>
<p>Add non-U.S. scores</p>
<p>286  Colin Montgomerie (Britain) 69 69 73 75</p>
<p>287  Jesper Parnevik (Sweden) 72 66 74 75</p>
<p>289  Craig Parry (Australia) 70 70 74 75</p>
<p>290  Nick Faldo (Britain) 71 68 75 76</p>
<p>291  Sandy Lyle (Britain) 67 71 78 75</p>
<p>295  Grant Waite (New Zealand) 72 68 76 79</p>
<p>297  Naomichi &quot;Joe&quot; Ozaki (Japan) 70 72 76 79</p>
</text>
